  "steps": [
   "Heat the oven to 200°C (180°C fan). Tip the tomatoes, mushrooms and garlic into a roasting tray with the oil, balsamic vinegar, salt and a good grind of pepper, and toss everything together.",
   "Roast for 15 minutes, until the tomatoes are starting to split and the mushrooms have shrunk and turned golden.",
   "Give the tray a stir, then make four gaps and crack an egg into each. Return to the oven for 8 to 10 minutes, until the whites are set and the yolks are still soft.",
   "While the eggs cook, toast the bread and spread each slice thickly with ricotta.",
   "Spoon the tomatoes, mushrooms and eggs over the toast with the juices from the tray. Scatter over the basil and add a pinch of chilli flakes if you like."
